# Repo-owned and hand-maintained. OpenOrchestrate only appends
# `.openorchestrate/`; its ensurePrettierIgnore is append-only and never
# rewrites this file. Keep the submodule list below in sync with .gitmodules.
.openorchestrate/

# Worker checkouts are git submodules: separate repositories with their own
# history and their own gates. Formatting them from here would leave 11 dirty
# submodules and would not stick. The parent repo still checks every file it
# owns, including workers/dashboard (which lives in this repo, not a submodule).
workers/agent-worker/
workers/analytics-worker/
workers/d1-worker/
workers/email-worker/
workers/hoox-worker/
workers/pyne-agent-worker/
workers/pyne-worker/
workers/report-worker/
workers/telegram-worker/
workers/trade-worker/
workers/web3-wallet-worker/

# Generated by scripts/sync-dashboard-configs.ts from each worker's
# dashboard.jsonc. The copies must stay strict JSON — the dashboard loader
# parses them with JSON.parse — so they cannot carry the repo-wide trailing
# commas. The generator validates every copy against the dashboard Zod schema;
# formatting them here would only be undone on the next `bun run build`.
workers/dashboard/public/workers/
